      "homePageType": "html",
      "homePageValue": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Meridian Finance Group - EMEA Finance Operations Analytics</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f7fdf9;\n            color: #1a2e1a;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .header {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #022c22 0%, #064e3b 50%, #065f46 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .header-content {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n\n        .tagline {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            opacity: 0.9;\n            font-weight: 300;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .welcome-section {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.08);\n            border-left: 4px solid #065f46;\n        }\n\n        .welcome-section h1 {\n            color: #1a2e1a;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .welcome-section p {\n            color: #4b7a5a;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            color: #1a2e1a;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .section-title::before {\n            content: '';\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 24px;\n            background: #065f46;\n            margin-right: 12px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 1.75rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.08);\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n            border-top: 3px solid #065f46;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card.accent-1 { border-top-color: #065f46; }\n        .kpi-card.accent-2 { border-top-color: #047857; }\n        .kpi-card.accent-3 { border-top-color: #059669; }\n\n        .kpi-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-title {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #065f46 0%, #059669 100%);\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-value {\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #1a2e1a;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-change {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-change.positive { color: #10b981; }\n        .kpi-change.negative { color: #ef4444; }\n        .kpi-change-icon { font-weight: bold; }\n\n        .quick-stats {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n            gap: 1rem;\n            margin-top: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .stat-item {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7fdf9 0%, #f0fdf4 100%);\n            padding: 1.25rem;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            border: 1px solid #d1fae5;\n        }\n\n        .stat-label {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .stat-value {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #065f46;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .header { padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }\n            .logo { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n            .welcome-section { padding: 1.5rem; }\n            .welcome-section h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n            .welcome-section p { font-size: 1rem; }\n            .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .kpi-value { font-size: 2rem; }\n            .quick-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">Meridian Finance Group</div>\n            <div class=\"tagline\">EMEA Finance Operations &amp; Business Intelligence Platform</div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <section class=\"welcome-section\">\n            <h1>Welcome to Meridian Finance Group Analytics</h1>\n            <p>\n                Your unified EMEA finance operations intelligence platform. Analyse business transaction data,\n                track project profitability, and surface operational insights across all regions with confidence.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n                From invoice-to-cash performance to cross-border project margins, our platform gives your\n                finance teams a real-time view of the numbers that matter most.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Key Performance Indicators</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"kpi-grid\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-1\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Total Revenue</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">€</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">€24.7M</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span class=\"kpi-change-icon\">▲</span>\n                    <span>11.3% vs last quarter</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-2\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Project Margin</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">%</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">34.2%</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span class=\"kpi-change-icon\">▲</span>\n                    <span>2.8 pts vs last quarter</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-3\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Active Projects</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">📁</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">1,847</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span class=\"kpi-change-icon\">▲</span>\n                    <span>14% vs last quarter</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-1\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">EBITDA Margin</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">↑</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">18.3%</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span class=\"kpi-change-icon\">▲</span>\n                    <span>1.5 pts vs last quarter</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-2\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">EMEA Regions Active</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">🌍</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">28</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span class=\"kpi-change-icon\">▲</span>\n                    <span>3 new this quarter</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-3\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Forecast Accuracy</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">🎯</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">96.8%</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span class=\"kpi-change-icon\">▲</span>\n                    <span>0.9% improvement</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Quick Statistics</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\">\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Open Invoices</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">342</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">At-Risk Projects</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">18</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Q3 Closings</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">89</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Active Clients</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">1,247</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>&copy; 2024 Meridian Finance Group. All rights reserved. | EMEA Finance Operations Analytics</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
